+\* Mutant: the owner unwraps a failed authoritative read into the same
+\* missing observation as a successful empty result. The existing retryable
+\* recovery fallback therefore never sees the failure.
+SPECIFICATION Spec
+CONSTANTS
+  CollapseFailureToMissing = TRUE
+INVARIANT TypeOK
+INVARIANT SuccessfulEmptyNeverDispatches
+INVARIANT NonRetryableFailureNeverDispatches
+INVARIANT FallbackRequiresCanonicalRecoveryEvidence
+PROPERTY EventuallyPriorityRecoveryDispatch
+CHECK_DEADLOCK FALSE
